# Copy to .env (gitignored):  cp .env.example .env   (PowerShell: Copy-Item .env.example .env)
#
# .env holds ONLY evaluator-provided data — your Anthropic API key. Everything else is auto-managed:
# ParaBank test credentials live in test_data/parabank_credentials.json and are auto-seeded/refreshed by
# scripts/run_capability.py (and scripts/seed_parabank_accounts.py). You never hand-edit them.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# ===========================================
# ANTHROPIC API KEY (required only for discovery)
# ===========================================
# Needed only to DISCOVER a new capability (run_capability.py --goal ..., or `python -m src.cli discover`).
# Plain replay of a bundled capability needs no key. Get one at: https://console.anthropic.com/
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
